    <dashboard enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='04 - Statistical Analysis'>
      <layout-options>
        <title>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>What Does the Statistical Analysis Tell Us?</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </title>
      </layout-options>
      <style />
      <size maxheight='800' maxwidth='1000' minheight='800' minwidth='1000' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='4' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='98000' id='11' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98400' x='800' y='1000'>
            <zone h='4625' id='12' type-v2='title' w='98400' x='800' y='1000'>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone h='93375' id='7' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98400' x='800' y='5625'>
              <zone h='93375' id='5' type-v2='layout-basic' w='98400' x='800' y='5625'>
                <zone h='72500' id='3' name='Regression Coefficients' w='81400' x='800' y='5625'>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='20875' id='13' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='78125'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>Overall conclusion</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>The results provide partial support for the research hypothesis. Urbanization showed the strongest and most robust association with NCD mortality change: larger increases in urban population share were associated with larger increases—or smaller declines—in NCD mortality. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>GDP growth was associated with larger declines in NCD mortality in the primary model, but this association was no longer statistically significant in the sensitivity analysis and is therefore not considered robust. Health expenditure showed no significant association in either model. Overall, the primary model explained 11.5% of the variation in cross-country NCD mortality changes, indicating that these three factors account for only a modest share of the differences between countries and that other factors likely contribute to the observed patterns. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10' italic='true'>These results indicate associations, not causal effects.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#c0c0c0' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='72500' id='14' type-v2='text' w='17000' x='82200' y='5625'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>Key findings</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>GDP per capita</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>Negative association in the primary model, but the result was sensitive to influential observations.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>Health expenditure</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>No statistically significant association with NCD mortality change.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>Urbanization</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>Positive and statistically significant association in both the primary and sensitivity analyses.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>How to read the chart</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>Coefficients show the estimated association with NCD mortality change. Horizontal lines represent 95% confidence intervals. Intervals crossing zero indicate that the coefficient is not statistically significant. The sensitivity analysis excludes eight influential observations identified using Cook&apos;s distance.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
              </zone>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <devicelayouts>
        <devicelayout auto-generated='true' name='Phone'>
          <layout-options>
            <title>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>What Does the Statistical Analysis Tell Us?</run>
              </formatted-text>
            </title>
          </layout-options>
          <size maxheight='700' minheight='700' sizing-mode='vscroll' />
          <zones>
